# Allow-list: the image needs the package sources and the files pyproject.toml references, nothing else
# (no data, results, models, corpora, notebooks, local venvs or caches).
*
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!LICENSE
!THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
!mrcd/
!docker/constraints.txt
!docker/entrypoint.sh
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
